3. She believes her recent illness was caused by eating something bad. (Verbatim: "I think I just ate something bad or something.")
4. She has a brother who once contracted scarlet fever and was quarantined. (Verbatim: "i remember in school ellie bro got um scarlet fever... he was like quarantined to his room for like for like")
5. She dreams frequently about streaming and cleaning her living space. (Verbatim: "i stream in my dreams quite a lot... last night mostly i dreamed about cleaning my kitchen and my bedroom.")
