7. She likes Belvita biscuits and considers them one of the few healthy things she eats. (Verbatim: "Belvita seems to be the only okay thing.")
8. She enjoys pancakes and expressed a strong desire for them. (Verbatim: "I would love some pancakes. Please, please, please, please, please.")
9. She was previously told her voice wasn't suitable for VTubing, especially not "cute enough," but now feels better about it due to viewer support. (Verbatim: "i was always told that like my voice wasn't cute enough or you know suited to vtubing.")
10. She was advised to use a higher, fake voice for VTubing but prefers using her natural voice. (Verbatim: "oh yeah like i was told i should do a higher fake voice um which i couldn't... i like doing my normal voice.") [end of text]



1. Elia's lore states she is a celestial messenger who came to Earth but was hit by a truck while flying and reincarnated as a British girl. (Verbatim: "in my lore okay I'm a celestial messenger that came down to earth but then I got hit by a truck while flying down and got isekai'd into a British girl")

