3. She is mixed race, with her and her older brother inheriting Asian traits from their mother, while her younger brother inherited English traits from their father. (Verbatim: "we are mixed race okay so we have you know inherited different genes from our parents me and older ellie bro got our skin gene from from mama ellia who's asian little ellie bro inherited the english skin gene")

