1. She was known as the "bathroom ghost" legend at her primary school, which was actually her being mistaken for a ghost in the girls' bathroom. (Verbatim: "i became a ghost legend at my school... i was the ghost of the girl's bathroom huh when really i'm not a ghost i'm not a ghost okay like i should go back i should go back")

