4. She does not believe she has any particularly spectacular talent but is extremely passionate about her goal of spreading happiness. (Verbatim: "i'm not anything special i don't think i have any particular spectacular talent but i'll give you my give you my best and i'm just extremely passionate about my goal")

5. She wishes she could be a superhero, though she jokes that she would not be very good at it because she is lazy. (Verbatim: "am i a superhero oh gosh i didn't think i'm superhero worthy... i wish i was a superhero that'd be cool i wouldn't be very good i'm quite lazy but you know yeah")

6. She forgets to take pictures of her food, even after cooking, because her hunger overrides the thought process. (Verbatim: "hunger overrides my my thought process okay hunger overrides it very much so so when i see food... i'm just like and then i'm like oh picture picture")

