8. She expresses a fondness for glasses and enjoys their versatility in style and aesthetic appeal. (Verbatim: "glasses are really versatile first you can have glasses wearing girls take them off and suddenly become beautiful... being able to switch up the styles and colors of glasses based on your mood is a lot of fun too")

9. She jokes about being a "dada dada" type of VTuber, indicating a nurturing or parental persona toward her audience. (Verbatim: "i'm the dada dada okay i can i can love you guys")

10. She feels deeply attached to her audience and identifies as the one who is "down bad" in the parasocial relationship. (Verbatim: "i'm the one that's down bad i'm the one dreaming of you guys okay i'm the one spending every second of every day trying to figure out how to do more for you guys") [end of text]



